 176:../../../shields/IIM423xx/src/Iim423xxDriver_HL.c **** 
 177:../../../shields/IIM423xx/src/Iim423xxDriver_HL.c **** 	/* Subroutines need to be followed when enabling or disabling sensor to ensure ODR regularity
 178:../../../shields/IIM423xx/src/Iim423xxDriver_HL.c **** 	 * Check if the accelerometer is the only one enabled 
